# sent_id = 1.3.1
# text = QUALIS Thesea iacuit cedente carina languida desertis Gnosia litoribus; qualis et accubuit primo Cepheia somno libera iam duris cotibus Andromede; nec minus assiduis Edonis fessa choreis qualis in herboso concidit Apidano: talis visa mihi mollem spirare quietem Cynthia non certis nixa caput manibus, ebria cum multo traherem vestigia Baccho, et quaterent sera nocte facem pueri.
# prose_translation = Just as the Gnosian (Ariadne) lay languid on the deserted shores when the ship of Theseus departed; and just as Cepheian Andromeda reclined in her first sleep, now free from the hard rocks; and no less, just as the Edonian (maenad), exhausted by constant dances, fell by the grassy Apidanus: so did Cynthia seem to me to breathe soft rest, resting her head on unsteady hands, when I was dragging my steps drunk with much wine, and the boys were shaking the torch in the late night.
# literal_translation = Just-as the Thesean ship having-departed lay languid Gnosian on-deserted shores; just-as also reclined in-first Cepheian sleep free now from-hard rocks Andromeda; nor less by-constant dances Edonian exhausted just-as on-grassy fell Apidanus: such seemed to-me to-breathe soft rest Cynthia on-not-certain resting head hands, drunk when I-was-dragging steps with-much Bacchus, and were-shaking late in-night torch the-boys.
