# sent_id = 1.3.3
# text = et modo solvebam nostra de fronte corollas ponebamque tuis, Cynthia, temporibus ; et modo gaudebam lapsos formare capillos; nunc furtiva cavis poma dabam manibus ; omniaque ingrato largibar munera somno, munera de prono saepe voluta sinu ; et quotiens raro duxit suspiria motu, obstupui vano credulus auspicio, ne qua tibi insolitos portarent visa timores, neve quis invitam cogeret esse suam: donec diversas praecurrens luna fenestras, luna moraturis sedula luminibus, compositos levibus radiis patefecit ocellos.
# prose_translation = And now I was untying the garlands from my brow and placing them on your temples, Cynthia; and now I was rejoicing to shape your fallen locks; then I was giving secret apples with hollow hands; and I was lavishing all gifts on ungrateful sleep, gifts often rolled from my sloping lap; and whenever she drew a sigh with a rare movement, I was stunned, credulous in a vain omen, lest some vision should bring you unaccustomed fears, or lest anyone should force you, unwilling, to be his own: until the moon, running before the different windows, the moon busy with lingering lights, with gentle rays laid bare your composed eyes.
# literal_translation = and now I-was-untying our from brow garlands and-placing on-your, Cynthia, temples ; and now I-was-rejoicing fallen to-arrange hairs; now secret in-hollow apples I-was-giving hands ; and-all I-was-lavishing to-ungrateful gifts to-sleep, gifts from sloping often rolled lap ; and as-often-as with-rare drew sighs movement, I-was-stunned in-vain credulous omen, lest any to-you unaccustomed bring visions fears, or lest anyone unwilling force to-be his-own: until different running-before moon windows, moon with-lingering busy lights, composed with-gentle rays laid-bare eyes.
