# sent_id = 1.14.1
# text = Tv licet abiectus Tiberina molliter unda Lesbia Mentoreo vina bibas opere, et modo tam celeres mireris currere lintres et modo tam tardas funibus ire rates; et nemus omne satas intendat vertice silvas, urgetur quantis Caucasus arboribus ; non tamen ista meo valeant contendere amori : nescit Amor magnis cedere divitiis.
# prose_translation = You may, though cast down, drink Lesbian wine softly by the Tiber's wave from a cup of Mentor's work, and now marvel that boats run so swiftly, and now that ships move so slowly with ropes; and let every grove stretch its planted trees to the summit, with as many trees as Caucasus is burdened; yet those things cannot contend with my love: Love does not know how to yield to great riches.
# literal_translation = You although cast-down Tiber's softly wave Lesbian Mentor's work wine may-drink, and now so swift marvel to-run boats and now so slow with-ropes to-go ships; and grove every planted at-summit stretch trees, is-burdened with-how-many Caucasus trees; not however those things to-my able-to-contend with-love: knows-not Love to-great to-yield riches.
