# sent_id = 1.14.5
# text = illa potest magnas heroum infringere vires, illa etiam duris mentibus esse dolor: illa neque Arabium metuit transcendere limen nec timet ostrino, Tulle, subire toro et miserum toto iuvenem versare cubili : quid relevant variis serica textilibus?
# prose_translation = She can break the great strength of heroes, she can even be a pain to hard hearts: she does not fear to cross the Arabian threshold, nor does she fear, Tullus, to approach the purple couch and to toss the wretched young man all over the bed: what do silk fabrics with their varied weaves avail?
# literal_translation = She can the great of-heroes break strengths, she even to-hard minds to-be pain: she neither the Arabian fears to-cross threshold nor fears, Tullus, on-purple to-go-under bed and the-wretched young-man all-over-the-bed to-turn: what do-avail with-varied silken weaves?
