# text = hoc si quis vitium poterit mihi demere, solus Tantalea poterit tradere poma manu ; dolia virgineis idem ille repleverit urnis, ne tenera assidua colla graventur aqua; idem Caucasia solvet de rupe Promethei bracchia et a medio pectore pellet avem.
# prose_translation = If anyone can remove this fault from me, he alone will be able to hand over the apples of Tantalus with his hand; that same man will have filled the jars with the maidens' urns, lest the tender necks be weighed down by the constant water; the same man will release the arms of Prometheus from the Caucasian rock and will drive the bird from the middle of his chest.
# literal_translation = this if anyone the fault will be able from me to remove, alone with Tantalus's hand will be able to hand over the apples; the jars with the maidens' urns that same man will have filled, lest the tender necks by the constant water be weighed down; the same man from the Caucasian rock of Prometheus will release the arms and from the middle of the chest will drive away the bird.
