# prose_translation = The painted faces of young men hurt me, the names hurt me, the tender boy in the cradle and without a voice; my mother will hurt me if she gives you many kisses, my sister and the girlfriend with whom she sleeps together: everything will hurt me: I am timid (forgive my fear) and, wretched, I suspect that there is a man in the tunic.
