# prose_translation = I will endure everything: let the savage East Wind press hard; let the cold South Wind drive the sails into uncertainty; and you winds, whoever you are, who have harassed wretched Ulysses, and the thousand ships of the Greeks on the Euboean shore; and you who have moved two shores, when the ship Argo was sent as a guide by a dove sent into the unknown sea.
