# sent_id = 3.3.7
# text = e quarum numero me contigit una dearum (ut reor a facie, Calliopea fuit): "Contentus niveis semper vectabere cycnis, nec te fortis equi ducet ad arma sonus.
# prose_translation = Of their number one of the goddesses touched me (as I guess from her face, it was Calliope): "Content, you will always be carried on snow-white swans, nor will the sound of a brave horse lead you to arms.
