# prose_translation = I will tell of the mother's offspring struck by Aetna's thunderbolt, of Indian arms put to flight by Nysa's dances, of Lycurgus driven mad in vain upon the new vine, of the welcome deaths of Pentheus among his threefold bands, and of the curved bodies of dolphins that leapt down Tyrrhenian sailors into the waves from a ship of vine-leaves, and of the sweet-smelling rivers flowing through the middle of Naxos for you, from which the Naxian crowd drinks your wine.
