# prose_translation = But now I give you these instructions, if perhaps you are moved, if the herb of Chloris does not hold you entirely: nurse Parthenie, let her not want anything in her trembling years; she could, and she was not greedy toward you: and my darling Latris, whose name comes from her service, let her not hand the mirror to her new mistress: and whatever verses you have made in my name, burn them; stop having my praises.
