# sent_id = 4.10.9
# text = Cossus at insequitur Veientis caede Tolumni, vincere cum Veios posse laboris erat, heu Vei veteres ! et vos túm regna fuistis, et vestro posita est aurea sella foro : nunc intra muros pastoris bucina lenti cantat, et in vestris ossibus arva metunt.
# prose_translation = But Cossus follows with the slaughter of Tolumnius of Veii, when it was a labor to be able to conquer Veii. Alas, ancient Veii! And you were kingdoms then, and a golden chair was placed in your forum. Now within the walls the horn of a slow shepherd sounds, and in your bones they reap the fields.
